Package: libsoup-3.0-0
Version: @DEB_LIBSOUP3_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://libsoup.org/
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libpsl5, libxml2, libnghttp2-14, libsqlite3-1
Description: HTTP client/server library for GNOME (libsoup 3) - runtime
 libsoup is an HTTP client/server library built on GLib/GIO. This package
 contains the libsoup-3.0 shared library. HTTPS additionally needs the
 glib-networking GIO TLS module at runtime (separate, optional).
